# What never enters the demo images (Dockerfile.demo; BuildKit reads this file instead of .dockerignore for that
# Dockerfile). Unlike .dockerignore it lets dataset/, model/ and database/*.json in: the demo api carries the data.
# Secrets, the git-ignored intermediates (rebuilt by the pipeline) and the raw PDF corpus of the team drive stay out.
# docs/ goes in without its screenshots: the assistant indexes docs/HELP.md and the other documents (llm/rag.py).
.git
.gitignore
.claude
.vscode
.idea
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.venv
venv
.pytest_cache
.env
.env.*
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
frontend/*.tsbuildinfo
database/*.db
database/*.db-journal
temp
backups
deploy/certs
docs/screenshots
tests
mlruns
*.tar
*.tar.gz
dataset.zip
Dataset drive folder
dataset/rag
dataset/clean/_parts
dataset/clean/performance/performance_detail.csv
dataset/clean/projects/project_summaries.csv
dataset/clean/projects/projects_monthly.csv
dataset/clean/projects/projects_quarterly.csv
dataset/silver/typed_rows.parquet
dataset/silver/identity/resolved_rows.parquet
dataset/raw/inbox/*
!dataset/raw/inbox/README.md
